@startuml comServiceStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Ready

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Ready : Init() / register RxCallback, TxCallback
Ready --> Uninitialized : DeInit() / deregister callbacks

Ready --> Ready : Run() [flush Tx if !txBusy]
Ready --> Ready : RxCallback() [ISR: store to Rx ring-buffer]
Ready --> Ready : TxCallback() [ISR: txBusy = false]
Ready --> Ready : IsRxDataAvailable()
Ready --> Ready : Read() [data available]
Ready --> Ready : Write() [buffer not full]

note right of Ready
  RX: Data arrives via registered callback
  from Serial Driver ISR context.
  TX: Run() flushes Tx ring-buffer when
  txBusy == false.
end note
@enduml
